      "name": "Shared Paracausal Conduit",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/symbols/circle-outer-ring-cyan.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>All active manifestations share a single unified hit point reserve called the <strong>Conduit Pool</strong> (<code>10 + 5 * @classes.meta-physicist.levels</code>). When an area-of-effect spell or hazard damages multiple manifestations at once, damage is deducted from the Conduit Pool only once for that instance. If the Conduit Pool drops to 0 HP, all active manifestations immediately destabilize and dissipate.</p>"
        },
        "source": {
          "custom": "Suns of Rubi"
